  "icon": "🏪",
  "description": "Since 2004, Southern Rose Parasailing & Dolphin Cruises has been offering the best parasailing adventures in Orange Beach, Gulf Shores and Perdido Key. Whether you are an experienced veteran or this is your first outing, experience the thrill of flying with the best adventure company on Alabama's Gulf Coast. We have the largest fleet of parasail boats in the area, and all of our vessels and crew are U.S. Coast Guard approved. Soar up to 800 feet in the air and admire the views of Alabama's picturesque coastline. Parasailing is available for all ages (3 and up), with double and triple parasailing adventures. We also offer dolphin cruises, jet ski rentals, banana boat rides, boat rentals, and jet ski dolphin tours.",
